00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:27.527
which you'll finally expose as an A2A server. Let's go.

11
00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:32.894
Now, you're going to create an A2A agent which also uses MCP.

12
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.502
And this agent is being

13
00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.904
built using the popular AI agent framework LangGraph.

14
00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.707
So first, we need to create an MCP server.

15
00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:44.677
We're going to be creating this MCP server using the FastMCP library.

16
00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:47.881
So I'll again use the writefile Jupyter magic

17
00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:51.384
to define this as a separate file called mcpserver.py

18
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:55.355
Once again, we'll import some libraries including FastMCP.

