00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.900
I'll call it find_healthcare_providers, and run

57
00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.103
the MCP server over standard IO,

58
00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.705
using uv run mcpserver.py.

59
00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:55.708
Just to clarify in this case, the MCP server

60
00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:58.711
is running as a subprocess of the Python script,

61
00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.880
not as a separate HTTP server.

62
00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:05.518
Then, I'll convert the MCP client into a LangGraph tool.

63
00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:10.390
Now, I'll create the agent using the LangChain create_agent method.

64
00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.293
I'll use the ChatOpenAI class for the model.

65
00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:16.029
The name will be OpenAI GPT

66
00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:18.898
OSS 20 billion model as a service.

