69
00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:29.475
I'll add in the tools, give this agent a name,

70
00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:32.679
and add in the system_prompt, which will task the agent

71
00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:35.481
with using the MCP tool to find healthcare providers

72
00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:37.951
based on the user's query. Now, in my

73
